~ reconnaissance
Mélos: The enemies are gone... But this world remains so gray and lifeless.
String Spirit: Do not despair, mortal. I have observed your journey from the shadows, and you have done phenomenal work with your strings.
Mélos: Who are you?! 
String Spirit: I am the Spirit of Strings. This world was plunged into this dark, colorless oblivion by the Spirit of Silence, who drained every spark of life from our lands.
String Spirit: To aid you on your quest, take this magic vial. It has been added to your inventory.
String Spirit: To use it and bring back some of the world's colors, open your inventory, scroll to select the potion, and press Q to use it.
Mélos: Thank you. I can feel hope returning.
String Spirit: May the harmony guide your steps. Farewell!
=> END